  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7024%2F7024.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    🔍 伊豆熱川温泉 迎賓館 玉翠のお得な伊勢海老料理＆宿泊プランはこちら →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【静岡県】迎賓館 玉翠の魅力と宿泊満足度</h2>\n\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">静岡県・東伊豆熱川温泉の湯煙たなびく高台に静かに佇む「伊豆熱川温泉 迎賓館 玉翠」は、和の気品と至高のおもてなしが息づく最高級温泉旅館です。</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">すべてのお部屋に自家源泉100%掛け流しの温泉露天風呂を備え、お部屋やテラスからは相模湾の青い海が一望。伊勢海老や特大金目鯛を味わう個室会席が一生の感動をお届けします。</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hotel-card\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-6\">温泉・客室・食事・駐車場アクセス情報</h2>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">迎賓館 玉翠</h3>\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.94 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7024/7024.jpg\" alt=\"迎賓館 玉翠\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-stone-100\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p><strong>【静岡県】</strong> 静岡県</p>\n      <p><strong>【エリア】</strong> 東伊豆・河津</p>\n      <p><strong>【温泉・風呂】</strong> 熱川温泉の自家源泉100%掛け流し。全客室温泉露天風呂完備＆情緒ある大浴場。</p>\n      <p><strong>【駐車場】</strong> 敷地内無料駐車場完備（約20台・ドアマンお出迎え）。</p>\n      <p><strong>【お食事】</strong> 伊豆特産「伊豆熱川温泉 迎賓館 玉翠」や伊勢海老のお造り、駿河湾の厳選海鮮を味わう極上和食個室会席。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7024%2F7024.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm rounded-2xl shadow-lg\">\n      ✈️ 迎賓館 玉翠 の最新空室状況・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-10 p-6 bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200/80 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">🔗 【あわせて読みたい】静岡県・近隣エリアの人気旅特集</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-800\">\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/1570\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">ホテルコンコルド浜松の温泉・客室口コミと宿泊予約</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/autumn-shizuoka-izu-shimoda-10selection\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">【2026】秋の静岡・伊豆下田を旅する！白浜海岸の絶景夕日と金目鯛・オーシャンビュー宿10選</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/128491\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">天然温泉　富嶽の湯　ドーミーイン三島の温泉・客室口コミと宿泊予約</a></li>\n    <li>👉 <a href=\"/posts/atagawa-ichiryuukaku-review-guide\" class=\"text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-600 underline text-xs\">【2026最新】熱川温泉 一柳閣の口コミ！絶景屋上パノラマ露天風呂と伊豆特大金目鯛姿煮海鮮会席</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-6\">\n  <div class=\"border-b border-amber-200 pb-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-2\">\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        🏨 石和温泉　ホテル古柏園 宿泊前に知っておきたい詳細スペック＆設備\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-1\">伊豆熱川温泉 迎賓館 玉翠のお風呂・お食事・館内設備・アクセス情報の詳細ガイド</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full border border-amber-300\">総合評価 ⭐ 4.2 (942件)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n    <!-- 温泉・お風呂 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          ♨️ 温泉・お風呂\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200\">お風呂 ★ 4.14 / 5.0</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>設備:</strong> 温泉・大浴場・露天風呂・天然温泉</li>\n        <li><strong>泉質:</strong> 単純温泉</li>\n        <li><strong>効能:</strong> アトピー・湿疹・美肌効果・疲労回復</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- お食事・グルメ -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🍽️ お食事スタイル・こだわり\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-orange-700 bg-orange-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-orange-200\">夕食★4.41 / 朝食★4.26</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading